{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/beverly-boulevard-hmb-homes-arjan","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":602,"crm_id":"412","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Beverly Boulevard","slug":"beverly-boulevard-hmb-homes-arjan","display_address":"Arjan","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"2024","developer":"HMB Homes","price":680000,"display_price":"680K","lattitude":25.0641875,"longitude":55.2338626,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":2,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Beverly Boulevard is a modern residential complex from the developer HMB Homes. The building consists of 8 floors and is designed in the style of elegant minimalism. The complex is located in one of the most developed areas of the Emirate of Arjan. The project supports eco-friendly solutions and offers appropriate infrastructure, including a charging station for electric cars. For sale are <strong>studios</strong> and spacious, elegant apartments with <strong>1 and 2 bedrooms.</strong> The interiors are designed in a contemporary style using warm, neutral tones, which creates a cozy atmosphere and combines functionality and style. Every detail, from sleek fittings to attractive light fixtures, mirrors and bathroom countertops is designed to perfection.</p><p>The complex has many amenities for comfortable living: lounge area with swimming pool and Jacuzzi, gym and studio for fitness, children's playground, barbecue areas and movie theater.</p><p>The project is located in close proximity to the main attractions of Dubai, as well as provides easy access to Sheikh Muhammad bin Salem Rood Street, which provides convenient connections to the cities. The famous flower and butterfly gardens are approximately 10 minutes away. Mall of the Emirates and Dubai Hills Mall can be reached in just 15 minutes, while Burj Khalifa is 20 minutes away. Dubai International Airport is 30 minutes away.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/412/images/2024/04/03/K2rMzwIfAJ7WCbQ5JAWxijZ3xHRczddHpt3Nb4i3.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/03/K2rMzwIfAJ7WCbQ5JAWxijZ3xHRczddHpt3Nb4i3.png","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/412/images/2024/04/03/bf8bhgcXqwJkNGs9N3mqyfBtsekPNqtmjPbPggJD.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/03/bf8bhgcXqwJkNGs9N3mqyfBtsekPNqtmjPbPggJD.png","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/412/images/2024/04/03/GUIHp4sQduP5Z3g0sLlAFrfWM7GrYGzD86prcBRa.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/03/GUIHp4sQduP5Z3g0sLlAFrfWM7GrYGzD86prcBRa.png","__ggfxIndex":2}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":2822,"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/2023/09/05/NOb0R0cEYUduJ5YdtbHO0u4bMH0FI0bSbcrtm9Ih.pdf","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":1059,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":1779,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"1 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":1780,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"2 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":1781,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"Studio","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null}],"payment_plan_text":"50/50 ","payment_plans":[{"id":5397,"title":"20%","description":"On booking"},{"id":5398,"title":"10%","description":"On 30% completion"},{"id":5399,"title":"10%","description":"On 50% completion"},{"id":5400,"title":"10%","description":"On 70% completion"},{"i